00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:36.760 line:95%
<c.magenta> -AUX ARMES CITOYENS </c>

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:40.280 line:95%
<c.magenta> FORMEZ VOS BATAILLONS </c>

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:43.040 line:95%
<c.yellow> -C'est génial, on sent, 
