00:24:45.320 --> 00:24:46.760 line:95%
 Extraordinaire, encore. 

00:24:46.920 --> 00:24:49.720 line:95%
 -Etre tous ensemble, 
 ne pas avoir peur des autres, 

00:24:49.880 --> 00:24:51.560 line:82%
